&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:9.5pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;② 【自己株式等】&lt;/span&gt;
