&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:13.5pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;(3) 【株主総会決議又は取締役会決議に基づかないものの内容】&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-indent:9.5pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsNotBasedOnResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingOrBoardOfDirectorsMeetingTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DisposalsOrHoldingOfAcquiredTreasurySharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:13.5pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;(4) 【取得自己株式の処理状況及び保有状況】&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:3pt;font-size:3pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:0.3pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:472.5pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
